# 1-rank kernel-throughput reference. msu_pe.data is UNRELAXED (E_pair~3e8 at
# step 0 from atom overlap), so we must use stage-1's nve/limit+langevin to
# relax safely before measuring -- plain nvt explodes (bonds fly past the comm
# cutoff). Same force field as lammps.in; Pair/Bond/Neigh per-section timing is
# kernel throughput, independent of the integrator/ensemble.
units           real
boundary        p p p
atom_style      molecular
read_data       msu_pe.data
neighbor        0.4 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 one 10000
bond_style      harmonic
bond_coeff      1 350 1.53
angle_style     harmonic
angle_coeff     1 60 109.5
dihedral_style  multi/harmonic
dihedral_coeff  1 1.73 -4.49 0.776 6.99 0.0
pair_style      lj/cut 10.5
pair_coeff      1 1 0.112 4.01 10.5
velocity        all create 500.0 1231
fix             1 all nve/limit 0.05
fix             2 all langevin 500.0 500.0 10.0 904297
timestep        1.0
thermo          1000
run             5000
